      en: ["The Euphrasian Basilica is a designated UNESCO World Heritage site", "Retains its original Roman street grid from the 1st century", "Served as a major Venetian stronghold for over five centuries", "Home to the 13th-century Romanesque House with a wooden balcony", "The coastline of the municipality is 37 kilometers long", "The nearby Baredine cave is a famous natural geo-monument"],
