      en: ["Zlatar was first mentioned in historical documents during the 13th century.", "The Week of Kajkavian Culture festival has been held annually since 1970.", "The parish church was constructed between 1758 and 1762 in the Baroque style.", "Mount Ivanščica is the highest peak in the region at 1,061 meters.", "Zlatar officially regained its city status in 1997.", "The town is a key judicial and administrative center for the Krapina-Zagorje County."],
